# Byte-exact fixtures: the recording corpus tests compare the parser's
# transcript with these files byte for byte, and the .cast streams carry
# the machine's own CR/LF. Git must never convert line endings here, or a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true turns the corpus tests red.
internal/gateway/record/testdata/** -text

# Every Go source is LF in the repository and in every checkout, so the
# working tree matches the blobs byte for byte on Windows too.
*.go text eol=lf
